  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fcf8e008252790b43ac0d8bd77edaab3, type: 3}
  m_Name: FallingObjectsVoiceOverData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  voiceOverEntries:
  - id: intro
    englishSubtitles: "Hey, I need you to do me a favour, can you to grab the cordless
      drill and bring it back to me. It\u2019s over in the compound sitting on the
      concrete blocks. Be quick! I\u2019m under a bit of pressure to get this job
      done"
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f6cde23a39bb70f4386cbc2715a1f479, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: first_teleport
    englishSubtitles: Teleport to the blue spot you see on the ground
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41035dccfbf9e6b40bc8cff6821f2c85, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: how_to_teleport
    englishSubtitles: Point the controller at the blue circle. A line should appear.
      Do you see it? When the line appears press and release the button your index
      finger is on.
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52fa1f3920af4ed49814afdca7b7c06d, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: second_teleport
    englishSubtitles: Yeah Straight ahead, can you see it?
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7844c38e6e0185a4196cafb9a413c1c3, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: grab_drill
    englishSubtitles: Now with your free hand, reach out and grab the drill
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 431732599ec940a49952146f673791ae, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: grab_drill_explanation
    englishSubtitles: Now with your free hand, reach out and grab the drill
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdba84e7240f5734d80406f62a71344f, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: return_way
    englishSubtitles: Perfect, now turn around and come back the way you came.
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb49816420b99134aa8a14d47bdd8820, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: post_accident_1
    englishSubtitles: 'STOP THE LIFT! Stop the lift! '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef677da9d4ec5ba4f9ffae4ebedc29c6, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: post_accident_2
    englishSubtitles: Are you okay? Don't move!
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b895c326e48a7d649a6d0ea61fac0da4, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: one_more_step
    englishSubtitles: 'One more step and that would have been the end of you. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 64fab5402b2b830448e68e50b2b0dbba, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_almost_crushed
    englishSubtitles: Well that was a lucky one! You were almost crushed!
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2817acf66f10b564eb583b67f583daef, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_look_around_you
    englishSubtitles: Right. Same Job. Only this time, before you move a foot, have
      a good look around you.
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5daef2c0546f6964a9a8dbfe78bcd740, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_exclusion_zone
    englishSubtitles: 'That orange colour on the ground is the exclusion zone. Nothing
      and nobody goes in there while that load is in the air. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5868bdd90355f4f48b1777dc6f2df8b6, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_banksman_intro
    englishSubtitles: 'See that lad in the white hat? That;s the banksman. He''s
      running that lift. Get hs attention. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f940cbb9848bc449a096de18099475c, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_wave_to_banksman
    englishSubtitles: Give him a wave so that he sees you!
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7b085b526d1ed4f439443e05b728adb5, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_stay_where_you_are
    englishSubtitles: 'Stay where you are. I''ve a load coming over. I''ll shout
      to you when it''s safe to cross. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 383e7a562a4885d4e8190ccb94e18356, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_waiting_speech_1
    englishSubtitles: 'I know. Standing here waiting in the last thing you want when
      you''re under pressure and somebody''s looking for that drill. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3b5967de47b1764497644ed32a52ccd, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_waiting_speech_2
    englishSubtitles: But you know what's worse than being waiting a minute? Being
      crushed if that load fails again. You barely escaped it last time.
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc1786665db223243a6927a8afd39174, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: correct_good_to_cross
    englishSubtitles: Okay! You're good to cross now!
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 88d370cbbeda5a44d88182b0c7037935, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: end_speech_1
    englishSubtitles: Good. All that cost is you is what? 15? 20 seconds?
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d485e8a85cb9664f87e1875aada339e, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: end_speech_2
    englishSubtitles: 'You need to be more aware of your surroundings at all times
      on-site. It only takes a split second for something to go wrong. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a3e921e460284a4aa26426eaef50eb7, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
  - id: end_speech_3
    englishSubtitles: 'You don''t want to be on the wrong end of that. Everyone thinks
      it will never happen to them...until it does. '
    englishAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb5758cac9cdd5b4788aca376eefe9b3, type: 3}
    romanianSubtitles: 
    romanianAudio: {fileID: 0}
